WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.714
Welcome to Orbit. Around the city. Our focus is can / cannot.

2
00:00:06.714 --> 00:00:13.052
Use can for ability or permission. The verb after can stays in its base form.

3
00:00:13.052 --> 00:00:15.681
He cannot find the station.

4
00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:18.525
We can speak English in class.

5
00:00:18.525 --> 00:00:20.634
Can she read a map?

6
00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:30.032
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
